      "dcDescription": [
        "African metal implements. Weapons, tools and regalia. 1984. New York.",
        "Republic of the Congo",
        "1954.01.1721",
        "Dolk med bred klinga av järn och träskaftet. Dolken är obrukbar och bärs endast av vuxna män som en del av klädnaden/ dräkten. \nDolken är identisk med den nedan beskrivna dolken från kuba (bakuba)./HTB\n\n\"The many versions of the type of ceremonial dagger that was carried by the Kuba all share the same general outline in which the pear-shaped blade and the handle with its standard combination of disk-shaped and cylindrical elements are regular features /.../ Serving no practical purpose whatsoever, these daggers were carried by the Kuba adult male as part of his costume.\"(African Metal Implements..., s.39)",
